    "description": "Assist customers with Oracle products running on platforms such as\nLinux, OS/390, AS/400, Unix, and VM. Products include gateways, databases, and front end GUI Oracle products.\n\nLead Oracle support analyst who works with customers interfacing non Oracle databases with Oracle products. Non Oracle databases include  SQL Server, UDB DB2, OS/390 DB2, SyBase, AS/400, MySQL , InFormix, TeraData, and Microsoft Access.\n\nOracle support analyst who works with customers on Oracle database install , patching, upgrade, configuration and migration issues for RAC and non RAC configurations running on windows, Unix or Linux platforms.\n\nDBA and software administrator for the group supporting gateways.\nSetup and maintain Oracle and non Oracle software on Linux, VM,  Solaris, AS/400, and Windows  operating systems.\n\nSupported Replication from non Oracle databases to Oracle databases using Golden Gate. Golden Gate replication from Oracle databases to non Oracle databases. (SQL Server, Sybase, TeraData, AS/400 DB2, \nZ/OS DB2).",
